koncepcja (6.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * konCePCja's own packaging. The recipe in debian/ was Caprice32's from
    2017 — package name, homepage, SDL2 build-dependency and all — and had
    never been touched; the Linux source archive shipped it as-is.
  * Builds the vendored SDL3 and installs it under /usr/lib/koncepcja.
  * Desktop entry and icon; the obsolete debian/menu entry is gone.
  * `make debian-changelog` regenerates this entry from the release
    version (.release-please-manifest.json); `make distrib` runs it.

